Alcarrid Oasis:
{{Stub|type=Page}}

'''Alcarrid Oasis''' is area within the [[Umbral Sands]], home of the [[Alcarrid Clan]], a clan of [[Garou (race)|garou]].

== Trivia ==

* The name, Alcarrid, is a play to {{RSL|Al Kharid}}, a city from ''{{RSL|RuneScape}}'', ''{{OSL|Old School RuneScape}} and {{RSCL|RuneScape Classic}}''
