Dunes of Uzzer:
{{Stub|type=Page}}

'''Dunes of Uzzer''' is an area within [[Umbral Sands]], home to the [[Uzzer Clan]], a clan of [[Garou (race)|garou]].

== Trivia ==
The name is a reference to {{RSL|Uzer}}, a remains of an advanced desert civilisation found in ''{{RSL|RuneScape}}'' and ''{{OSL|Old School RuneScape}}.''
{{Umbral Sands}}

