Hardcore:
{{Future content}}

'''Hardcore''' mode is a feature planned for a [[Upcoming updates|future update]], which would aim to make the base game experience much more difficult. It will primarily feature "permadeath"; a player who dies will not respawn, and a new world or character would need to be started from scratch.

While not currently confirmed, other features have been suggested that may be included, such as more aggressive, powerful, and plentiful enemies, or more punishing [[hydration]], [[sustenance]], and [[rest]].

