A '''vault core''' can be found on pedestals in [[dragonkin vault]]s. Their primary use is to make [[lodestone]]s, which serve as a teleport location that can be travelled to from any other lodestone the player has placed on the map. They are also components of several masterworks, such as the [[abyssal whip]] and [[dragonblight shield]]. Note that these respawn in their plinths every three in-game days, so their quantity is not limited.

